<title>USA: Information Management Q3 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Information Management Q3 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.21     loss	 $0.17</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 1,173     loss	   473</p>
<p> Revs			 2,627		    2,835</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Full name is Information Management Technologies Corp.</p>
<p>Third quarter 1996 ended Dec 31. It included a one-time charge of $550,000 related to staff reductions, equipment write off and re-alignment of production operations.</p>
